bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    test_runner_direct_lane_drops_mode_backend_flags_2026_11_09, 0, "Phase-2 gate lane (PR #8047): pinning SIMPLE_BINARY bypasses the daemon, but run_one_direct (src/app/test_runner_new/test_runner_client.spl:554) drops mode/backend flags (only --compiler= forwards). A requested native/smf/compile test run is silently interpreted in ~31 ms and would report PASS — fail-open evidence collection. Fix order #1 before any phase-2 retry. Repro: request --mode=native via a pinned-BINARY direct lane and observe tagged-interpreter execution with no diagnostic."

