bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    test_runner_direct_lane_drops_mode_backend_flags_2026_11_09, 0, "2026-11-09 phase-2 gate lane (work/boot-t2-testrunner-20261109): measured on a fresh HEAD seed — run_one_direct forwards only --compiler=; mode/backend flags lost; observed 31 ms interpreted run standing in for a native request with PASS verdict. Blocking phase-2 BuildRunner evidence."
    test_runner_direct_lane_drops_mode_backend_flags_2026_11_09, 1, "2026-11-09 fix-implemented-verification-pending (work/p3-runone-flags-20261109): fail-loud half landed. Root gap: run_one_direct (test_runner_client.spl:554) builds the inner invocation from only --timeout/--compiler=; neither client lane can honour a compiled mode (daemon request is path-only; the --no-session-daemon single lane always interprets, child = 'binary run <spec>' under pinned SIMPLE_EXECUTION_MODE=interpret). Fix: client_arg_shape.spl gains client_dropped_execution_flags(args) naming every dropped flag (--mode native|smf|compile|jit|... both spellings, --compile, --native-backend=...); test_runner_client.spl main() refuses (exit 2) naming them, before any lane selection. RED: direct_lane_mode_backend_flags_spec.spl 6/6 failed pre-fix, e2e example observed child exit 0 + LANE-MARKER execution_mode=interpret + PASS for a --mode=native request. GREEN post-fix: 6/6, child exit 2 naming --mode=native, marker absent; negative control (plain/--mode=interpreter) still runs and passes. Neighbours client_arg_shape/daemon_backlog_bypass/test_runner_client_validation_gate/child_spawn_binary_identity 20/20. Follow-up (same row): forwarding refactor — teach the single runner compiled lanes so the direct lane can honour instead of refuse."

